cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "COPI Editor"
abstract: >-
  A web-based research tool for building the Core Ontology for Petroleum
  Installations (COPI), a BFO 2020 / IOF-Core aligned OWL 2 DL ontology of
  oil & gas production equipment. It aggregates terms and definitions from
  industrial standards (ISO 15926-4, POSC Caesar RDL, CFIHOS, DEXPI, ISO 14224,
  ISA-5.1, among others) and supports a 5-step axiomatization workflow with
  expert review, OWL generation and quality checks.
authors:
